    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">but on a wednesday in a cafe (i watched it begin again)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;em&gt;They most definitely don't expect to be stopped in their tracks by how fucking gay they are.&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;em&gt;Woman.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;em&gt;Arms.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;em&gt;Muscles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;  &lt;em&gt;Pretty woman. Behind counter.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em&gt;-&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;5 times Catra walks into Bright Moon Cafe, exiting with just coffee and 1 time they leave with something more.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>catrasheart</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
