          <rdf:li>Bow Is a Good Friend (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>hints of trans bow</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>it's small but it's there</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Other</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inspired by Taylor Swift</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Song: Begin Again (Taylor Swift)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora is a swiftie</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and you can't change my fucking mind about it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>ok? ok.</rdf:li>
